# The Impeccable design tooling, vendored by `npx impeccable install` into the harness directory it
# detected. It is 3.5 MB of somebody else's tool, reinstallable in one command, and no part of the
# build or CI reads it. What it *produced* — PRODUCT.md, DESIGN.md and .impeccable/ — is committed,
# because that is this project's own design record.
.github/skills/
.github/agents/
.github/hooks/
